OL,3,GNEWSAMP attacks council over SEND
OL,4,Aassessment delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has accused Reform UK-led
OL,7,FWarwickshire County Council of failing
OL,8,Fchildren with special educational needs
OL,9,Fand disabilities (SEND), saying long
OL,10,Fdelays in assessments are leaving some
OL,11,Fyoung people without the support they
OL,12,Fneed.
OL,14,FManuela Perteghella, the Liberal
OL,15,FDemocrat MP for Stratford-on-Avon and a
OL,16,Fmember of the House of Commons
OL,17,FEducation Committee, said the
OL,18,Fauthority's performance was
OL,19,F"unacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
