OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMP attacks council over SEND
OL,4,Aassessment delays
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The first priority for me is that you
OL,7,Fget these plans and you put the
OL,8,Fresources to get these plans at least
OL,9,Fto, ideally, the national average," she
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FIn response, Warwickshire County
OL,13,FCouncil said a recovery plan was under
OL,14,Fway to increase capacity, reduce
OL,15,Fbacklogs and improve performance.
